<title>USA: Thermo Remediation Acquires IEM Sealand.</title>
<headline>Thermo Remediation Acquires IEM Sealand.</headline>
<dateline>WALTHAM, Mass. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermo Remediation Inc said on Tuesday it has acquired IEM Sealand Corp for approximately $1.7 million in cash and 311,000 shares of stock.</p>
<p>IEM Sealand is a privately held provider of remedial construction services to government and industry. For the fiscal year ended November 1995, IEM Sealand had revenues of approximately $6.9 million.</p>
<p>Thermo Remediation is a public subsidiary of Thermo Terratech Inc.</p>
